      "pinyin": "nián qīng rén mǎ shàng zhàn qǐ lai gěi tā ràng zuò",
      "english": "An old lady was going home by bus. Once she got on the bus, she stood beside a young man."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老太太说：“你坐吧，我还很年轻，不需要你给我让座！”",
      "traditional": "老太太說：“你坐吧，我還很年輕，不需要你給我讓座！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo tài tai shuō nǐ zuò ba wǒ hái hěn nián qīng bù xū yào nǐ gěi wǒ ràng zuò",
      "english": "The young man immediately stood up to give her his seat."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The old lady said, “You sit here, I’m still young. No need to give up your seat for me!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "过了一会儿，年轻人又站了起来。",
