    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "最后年轻人实在没办法了，哭着说：",
      "traditional": "最後年輕人實在沒辦法了，哭著說：",
      "pinyin": "zuì hòu nián qīng rén shí zài méi bàn fǎ le kū zhe shuō",
      "english": "The young man stood up four or five times, and each time the old lady told him that he didn’t need to give up the seat."
