    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Cordial Old Lady",
      "",
      "An old lady was going home by bus. Once she got on the bus, she stood beside a young man.",
      "The young man immediately stood up to give her his seat.",
      "The old lady said, “You sit here, I’m still young. No need to give up your seat for me!”",
      "",
      "After a while, the young man stood up again.",
      "The old lady said, “It’s all right, you really don’t need to give me your seat!”",
      "",
      "The young man stood up four or five times, and each time the old lady told him that he didn’t need to give up the seat.",
      "Finally the young man really had no choice but to tell the old lady in tears, ..",
      ".. “Auntie, I have already passed by home by several stops. I have to get off the bus!”"
    ]
  }
